		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_n01r0101_sage7_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>てんに　にじつ　なく
たみに　ふたりの　おう　なし▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-05T06:02:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>天に二日なく　民に二王なし▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-05T06:05:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・メッセージ表示後、七賢人全員
　主人公を囲む位置に移動しsage2_02に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>七賢人７</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_n01r0101_sage2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さて……▼
われらが　おうさまに
なにか　あっては　いちだいじ▼
ゲーチスさまの　かんぜんな
けいかくも　くずれさる　というもの▼
Ｎさまは　がっかり　なされるだろうが
われら　６にん▽
ここで　おまえを　たおしてみせる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さて……▼
われらが　王さまに
なにか　あっては　一大事▼
ゲーチスさまの　完全な
計画も　崩れさる　というもの▼
Ｎさまは　落胆なされるだろうが
われら　６人▽
ここで　おまえを　倒してみせる！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてleader5_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>七賢人２</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
